# Build output — deliberately NOT ignoring Assemblies/*.dll: Firefly.dll and its
# Newtonsoft.Json.dll runtime dependency (RimWorld doesn't bundle it, Harmony doesn't
# either) both need to be committed so a fresh "Download ZIP"/clone runs immediately with
# no build step, same as most published RimWorld mods (confirmed missing DLL was a real
# bug — 2026-08-22). Rebuild and re-stage Assemblies/Firefly.dll after any C# change.
bin/
obj/

